+        Then: Chapter list no longer contains Chapter 10.2.1 and still contains Chapter 10.2.1-Other. The former chapter pages are absent from the parent book's Page list and are not readable from their former URLs; Page 10.2.1-Root and Page 10.2.1-Other-Page remain. Recently Updated Pages, My Most Viewed Favorites and My Recently Viewed no longer contain Chapter 10.2.1 or Page 10.2.1-A. Reload preserves the chapter's absence.
